[00:18.00]If you believe in the power of magic
[00:23.00]I can change your mind
[00:27.00]And if you need to believe in someone
[00:32.00]Turn and look behind
[00:35.00]When we were living in a dream world
[00:40.00]Clouds got in the way
[00:44.00]We gave it up in a moment of madness
[00:49.00]And threw it all away

[00:52.00]Don't answer me
[00:55.00]Don't break the silence, don't let me win
[01:01.00]Don't answer me
[01:03.00]Stay on your island, don't let me in
[01:09.00]Run away and hide from everyone
[01:18.00]Can you change the things we've said and done?
[01:25.00]If you believe in the power of magic
[01:30.00]It's all a fantasy
[01:33.00]So if you need to believe in someone
[01:38.00]Just pretend it's me
[01:42.00]It ain't enough that we meet as strangers
[01:47.00]I can't set you free
[01:51.00]So will you turn your back forever
[01:55.00]On what you mean to me?

